{"<b class=\"text-gray-200\">Not financial advice.</b> Educational levels only, modelled from delayed open-interest data. Futures trading carries a high risk of loss. By using this page you accept the <a href=\"/legal/#terms\" class=\"underline hover:text-white\">Terms</a>.":"<b class=\"text-gray-200\">不是投资建议。</b>仅为教育用的价位，根据延迟的未平仓量数据计算。期货交易的亏损风险很高。使用本页面即表示你接受<a href=\"/legal/#terms\" class=\"underline hover:text-white\">使用条款</a>。","<b class=\"text-green-400\">Call Wall</b> — the strike with the biggest call positioning above price. Dealers hedging there often slow rallies down.":"<b class=\"text-green-400\">Call 墙</b>——价格上方 Call 持仓最大的行权价。在那里对冲的做市商常常会让上涨变慢。","<b class=\"text-red-400\">Put Wall</b> — the strike with the biggest put positioning below price. Often a floor where selling gets absorbed.":"<b class=\"text-red-400\">Put 墙</b>——价格下方 Put 持仓最大的行权价。常常是卖压被吸收的底部。","<b class=\"text-white\">{0}D vs Today</b> — {1}D = the big picture over the next three months. Today = only the options that expire today ({2}DTE).":"<b class=\"text-white\">{0}D vs 今天</b>——{1}D = 未来三个月的大局。今天 = 只看今天到期的期权（{2}DTE）。","<b class=\"text-yellow-300\">Zero Gamma / GEX Flip</b> — where dealer hedging changes from calming price to pushing it. Above it, moves tend to be calmer; below it, faster.":"<b class=\"text-yellow-300\">零伽马 / GEX Flip</b>——做市商的对冲从稳住价格变成推动价格的位置。在它上方，走势往往更平稳；在它下方，则更快。","Click <b class=\"text-white\">Copy</b> on your chart: the NQ block for NQ / MNQ, the ES block for ES / MES.":"根据你的图表点击<b class=\"text-white\">复制</b>：NQ / MNQ 用 NQ 块，ES / MES 用 ES 块。","Copy ES block for the indicator":"复制指标用的 ES 块","Copy NQ block for the indicator":"复制指标用的 NQ 块","ES / MES chart":"ES / MES 图表","Free · Updated every trading morning":"免费 · 每个交易日早晨更新","Gamma Levels for <span class=\"gold-text\">ES</span> and <span class=\"teal-text\">NQ</span>":"伽马水平：<span class=\"gold-text\">ES</span> 和 <span class=\"teal-text\">NQ</span>","Gamma Levels for ES and NQ | MMM Trading":"ES 和 NQ 的伽马水平 | MMM Trading","In TradingView open the settings of <b class=\"text-white\">Gamma Walls and Institutional Bias @MaxMaserati</b>.":"在 TradingView 中打开<b class=\"text-white\">Gamma Walls and Institutional Bias @MaxMaserati</b>的设置。","Index prices (SPX / NDX); the indicator converts them to futures. CBOE delayed data, naive open-interest model, may differ from other providers. History: <a id=\"g-hist\" href=\"https://maxmaseratii.github.io/gamma-levels/docs/gex_history.csv\" class=\"underline hover:text-white\">gex_history.csv</a>":"指数价格（SPX / NDX），由指标转换成期货价格。CBOE 延迟数据，简单的未平仓量模型，可能与其他数据商不同。历史数据：<a id=\"g-hist\" href=\"https://maxmaseratii.github.io/gamma-levels/docs/gex_history.csv\" class=\"underline hover:text-white\">gex_history.csv</a>","NDX spot {0}":"NDX 现价 {0}","NQ / MNQ chart":"NQ / MNQ 图表","Paste into <b class=\"text-white\">Paste Daily Block</b>, leave the three {0}D boxes at {1}, click OK.":"粘贴到<b class=\"text-white\">Paste Daily Block</b>，三个 {0}D 框保持 {1}，点击 OK。","SPX spot {0}":"SPX 现价 {0}","Show the block":"显示数据块","Today Call Wall":"今日 Call 墙","Today GEX Flip":"今日 GEX Flip","Today Put Wall":"今日 Put 墙","Today's strikes (gamma in $M)":"今日行权价（伽马，单位 $M）","Trading date {0}-{1}-{2} (Friday) · updated {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET (CBOE delayed data)":"交易日 {0}-{1}-{2}（周五）· 更新于 {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET（CBOE 延迟数据）","Trading date {0}-{1}-{2} (Monday) · updated {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET (CBOE delayed data)":"交易日 {0}-{1}-{2}（周一）· 更新于 {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET（CBOE 延迟数据）","Trading date {0}-{1}-{2} (Saturday) · updated {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET (CBOE delayed data)":"交易日 {0}-{1}-{2}（周六）· 更新于 {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET（CBOE 延迟数据）","Trading date {0}-{1}-{2} (Sunday) · updated {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET (CBOE delayed data)":"交易日 {0}-{1}-{2}（周日）· 更新于 {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET（CBOE 延迟数据）","Trading date {0}-{1}-{2} (Thursday) · updated {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET (CBOE delayed data)":"交易日 {0}-{1}-{2}（周四）· 更新于 {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET（CBOE 延迟数据）","Trading date {0}-{1}-{2} (Tuesday) · updated {3}-{4}-{5} {6}:{7} ET (CBOE delayed data)